      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Starship V4 will be ~70m long, which is roughly a 40% length increase and allows &gt;60% more propellant load.\n\nEngine count will be raised to 9, with 3 more Raptor-Vacuum engines added, and these will be higher thrust V4 engines.",
